&lt;p&gt;Published on: 2026-03-21T13:55:40+08:00 Updated on: 2026-03-21T13:56:37.908+08:00&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="article-detail-content-container"&gt;
&lt;div class="non-paywall"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;保誠				&lt;a class="inline-related-stock" href="https://invest.hket.com/data/HKG02378/?mtc=h0023"&gt;（02378）&lt;/a&gt;
